  "title": "Get ETF profile"
 },
 "description": "ETF look-through for Chapter 2 Mode 2.2 (Concentration Check). Given ETF ticker(s), returns each fund's top holdings with weights so the AI can overlay them with the user's direct positions and surface hidden single-name concentration. Each profile carries source='live' (Vanguard API, fresh) or source='catalog' (dated snapshot \u2014 see as_of). Holdings are TOP-N only, so any true-exposure figure computed from this is a floor, not exact. Bond and commodity ETFs return no holdings by design. Tickers not in the catalog come back in unknown_tickers; their contents are not known to Jawz and no holdings are returned for them.",
